<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  com.sma.daemon-watch.plist — the macOS twin of sma-daemon-watch-windows.task.xml: the
  LaunchAgent that keeps the DAEMON WATCHDOG alive.

  WHAT IT ADDS ON THIS PLATFORM, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT. com.sma.daemon.plist already carries
  KeepAlive, so on a Mac launchd relifts the daemon on any exit by itself — half of the
  answer was always here. What was never here is the TELLING: the window is the daemon's own
  web face and the Telegram polling is the same process, so between the death and launchd's
  relift both channels are silent, and a person living in the window and on their phone has
  no way to tell that silence from a quiet afternoon. The watchdog is what says it out loud,
  and it says it once per outage.

  SO THE TWO ARE COMPLEMENTARY, NOT RIVALS. When launchd wins the race and lifts the daemon
  before the watchdog has counted its silences, nothing is reported and nothing needs to be:
  an outage nobody could notice is not one. When the daemon stays down, the watchdog reports
  the fall and runs the lift itself. Either way «поднялся» is said by the risen daemon, after
  its own door answers — see daemon/src/outage.mjs.

  PLACEHOLDER CONVENTION, same as its sibling:
    <SMA_HOME>     absolute path of the SMA clone (e.g. /Users/worker/sma)
    <WORKER_HOME>  the auto-login worker user's home (launchd does not expand `~`)
    Node path: /opt/homebrew/bin/node on Apple Silicon, /usr/local/bin/node on Intel.

  KeepAlive true — the last turtle. A watchdog that dies is a watchdog nobody watches, and
  launchd is the thing under it that does not.

  INSTALL (owner only):
    cp supervisor/com.sma.daemon-watch.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.sma.daemon-watch.plist
    # edit the two placeholders in the copy, then:
    launchctl load -w ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.sma.daemon-watch.plist
  UNLOAD:
    launchctl unload -w ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.sma.daemon-watch.plist
-->
<plist version="1.0">
  <dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.sma.daemon-watch</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
      <string>/opt/homebrew/bin/node</string>
      <string>&lt;SMA_HOME&gt;/supervisor/daemon-watch.mjs</string>
    </array>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>

    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>&lt;WORKER_HOME&gt;/Library/Logs/sma-daemon-watch.log</string>

    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>&lt;WORKER_HOME&gt;/Library/Logs/sma-daemon-watch.err</string>

    <key>ProcessType</key>
    <string>Background</string>

    <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
    <string>&lt;SMA_HOME&gt;</string>
  </dict>
</plist>
